---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
<h1>Kilo Lima</h1>
<p>A minimal Eleventy site managed with <a href="https://pagescms.org">Pages CMS</a>.</p>

<h2>Posts</h2>
<ul class="post-list">
  {%- for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    &mdash; <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}</time>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
